  "note": "Envelope schema is public-root-v1, not a measurement card. This root.json envelope is Ed25519-signed over the compact preimage under did:web:csoai.org#board-attestation-1. Leaves MAY carry attestations — coverage harvest, not grades. Not MEASURED. Not a certificate. Free; not paywalled.",
